@_23_phanDangQuang_Assignment01_BackEnd_HostAddress = http://localhost:5278
@accessToken = paste-access-token-from-login-response
@staffEmail = staff-email-from-your-database
@staffPassword = staff-password-from-your-database

### Admin login (configured in Backend appsettings.json)
POST {{_23_phanDangQuang_Assignment01_BackEnd_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@FUNewsManagementSystem.org",
  "password": "@@abc123@@"
}

### Staff login (replace the variables above with an existing Staff account)
POST {{_23_phanDangQuang_Assignment01_BackEnd_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{staffEmail}}",
  "password": "{{staffPassword}}"
}

### Current identity (paste accessToken above; Admin, Staff or Lecturer)
GET {{_23_phanDangQuang_Assignment01_BackEnd_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Accounts (Admin: 200; Staff: 403; no token: 401)
GET {{_23_phanDangQuang_Assignment01_BackEnd_HostAddress}}/odata/Accounts?$count=true
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Categories (Staff: 200; Admin: 403; no token: 401)
GET {{_23_phanDangQuang_Assignment01_BackEnd_HostAddress}}/odata/Categories?$count=true
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Tags (Staff only)
GET {{_23_phanDangQuang_Assignment01_BackEnd_HostAddress}}/odata/Tags
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Published news (no login needed)

GET {{_23_phanDangQuang_Assignment01_BackEnd_HostAddress}}/odata/NewsArticles?$count=true
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{_23_phanDangQuang_Assignment01_BackEnd_HostAddress}}/odata/NewsArticles?$filter=contains(NewsTitle,'a')&$orderby=CreatedDate desc&$select=NewsArticleId,NewsTitle,CreatedDate&$top=5
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{_23_phanDangQuang_Assignment01_BackEnd_HostAddress}}/odata/NewsArticles?$skip=2&$top=2&$count=true
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{_23_phanDangQuang_Assignment01_BackEnd_HostAddress}}/odata/$metadata
Accept: application/xml
